          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha kiro ekya musanju eky'okwezi okw'okubanza okw'omwaka ogwa ikumi na gumu, MUKAMA akangambira ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Wewe mwana w'omuntu, Faraaho omukama wa Misiri, mmuhenzire omukono; kandi tigukabuyirwe nukwo gukire habw'okusembwa n'ekikoba nukwo gusobole kuba gw'amaani, kukwata empirima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikyo MUKAMA Ruhanga arukugambira ati: Nindwanisa Faraaho omukama wa Misiri, kandi ninyija kumuhenda emikono yombi, omukono omwomeezi, na guli ogwahendekere; nukwo mmunagise empirima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanyamisiri, ninyija kubararangya omu mahanga, mbataabanize omunsi ezindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emikono y'omukama wa Bbabbulooni, ndigifoora y'amaani, mmukwase empirima yange; baitu Faraaho ninyija kumuhenda emikono, alisindira omumaisoge, nk'omuntu anyakuhutaire obuhuta obw'okumwita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emikono y'omukama wa Bbabbulooni ndigifoora y'amaani, baitu eya Faaraho ndigicekya. Abantu nubwo balimanya nkooku ndi MUKAMA. Obu ndikwasa omukama wa Bbabbulooni empirima, alirwanisa ensi Misiri; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanyamisiri ndibararangya omu mahanga, mbataabaanize omu nsi ezindi. Abantu nubwo bamanye nkooku ndi MUKAMA.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
